    dcterms:creator "Wikidata contributors" ;
    dcterms:license <https://creativecommons.org/publicdomain/zero/1.0/> ;
    rdfs:comment "https://www.wikidata.org/wiki/Wikidata:Licensing (raw page text, fetched 2026-10-04): \"All structured data (i.e. the main, Property, Lexeme, and EntitySchema namespaces) is released into the public domain under Creative Commons Zero.\""@en .

<https://pubchem.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/>
    dcterms:title "PubChem: compound records of the 43 ions (molecular formula, charge, title and IUPAC name)" ;
    dcterms:creator "National Center for Biotechnology Information, US National Library of Medicine" ;
    rdfs:comment "https://www.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/home/about/policies/ (fetched 2026-10-04): \"Information that is created by or for the US government on this site is within the public domain.\" The same page notes that the site also holds material contributed by others; only PubChem-computed values were used: the molecular formula of the sulfate ion (CID 1117) is attributed to \"Computed by PubChem 2.2 (PubChem release 2025.09.15)\" (query 7), and the formula and charge of every ion were taken from the same computed property table."@en .

<https://iupac.org/wp-content/uploads/2016/07/Red_Book_2005.pdf>
    dcterms:title "Nomenclature of Inorganic Chemistry: IUPAC Recommendations 2005 (the Red Book)" ;
    dcterms:creator "International Union of Pure and Applied Chemistry (N. G. Connelly, T. Damhus, R. M. Hartshorn and A. T. Hutton, eds.)" ;
    rdfs:comment "Imprint page of the PDF (PDF page 4, read 2026-10-04): \"© International Union of Pure and Applied Chemistry, 2005. All rights reserved\". Verification only: nothing copied."@en .

<https://kemisamfundet.se/wp-content/uploads/2020/05/Skrivregler-S%C3%A4rtryck-Kemisk-Tidskrift.pdf>
    dcterms:title "Nya svenska skrivregler för kemi (särtryck ur Kemivärlden Biotech med Kemisk Tidskrift)" ;
    dcterms:creator "Svenska Kemisamfundets nomenklaturutskott (Swedish Chemical Society, nomenclature committee)" ;
    rdfs:comment "The PDF states no licence; the society's website footer (https://kemisamfundet.se/, fetched 2026-10-04) reads \"© 2015 Svenska Kemisamfundet – Alla rättigheter reserverade\". Verification only: nothing copied."@en .

<https://www.lth.se/fileadmin/kemigen/pdf/nomenklaturregler.pdf>
    dcterms:title "Nomenklatur - namngivning och formelskrivning (KemIgen, 2006-03-18)" ;
    dcterms:creator "KemIgen, Lunds tekniska högskola (Lund University)" ;
    rdfs:comment "The PDF (fetched 2026-10-04) carries no author, copyright or licence statement. LTH's website page on its sites, \"Om våra webbplatser\" (https://www.lth.se/om-vaara-webbplatser/, linked from the footer of https://www.lth.se/ as \"Om webbplatsen\"; fetched 2026-10-04, query 19), covers cookies and personal data only and states no copyright or licence terms. Treated as all rights reserved and used for verification only. Nothing copied."@en .

<https://sv.wikipedia.org/>
    dcterms:title "Svenskspråkiga Wikipedia" ;
    dcterms:creator "Wikipedia contributors" ;
